WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:07.340
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:24.080
Reikenzan: Hoshikuzu-tachi no Utage

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:28.960
Reikenzan: Hoshikuzu-tachi no Utage

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:37.470
We drew a scribbled map of the future with no defined end

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:44.170
But you smiled saying, "no matter how lost we get,

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:47.690
or how much we cry, the end will come"

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:54.850
If tomorrow was an untouched white canvas

00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.560
I'd like to see what kind of colors would shine the brightest

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:04.910
Like tears leaving behind a rainbow

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:10.850
I'll prove to you I can change this world

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:15.180
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:18.220
Listening to the footsteps of a tomorrow

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:22.400
whose name we've yet to know

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:57.680
It's over.

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:14.780
What?

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:24.840
What just happened?

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.160
What is this now?

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:27.750
Well...

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:28.960
How could this happen.

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:31.830
This is our biggest flop
since the sect was founded.

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:35.050
What? Is it already over?

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:37.340
I was just getting started.

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:40.590
Or is this a part of the plan...

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:45.520
Well, guess this sword is only
good for clearing one mission.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.890
What a crazy examiner,

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:53.560
letting me use such a powerful sword.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:57.150
Pretty dauntless though, I like that.

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:17.050
It can't be true! Is it really broken?

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:19.340
Is this karma?

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:23.800
This is really bad, I'll have to explain myself by blaming it all on Ryuken...

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:28.060
Look here kid, you've broken all the
barriers in the Frozen Wind Valley,

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:31.600
Red Ridge Mountain, Hades Den,
and Azure Cloud Peak all in one blow!

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:37.610
The test design is all messed up now,
and everyone will have to be considered a pass!

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:41.400
Wait, but isn't this supposed to be
a part of the mission's design?

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.530
Part of the design, my ass!

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:47.160
How stupid would I be to include something so
powerful, that it could destroy all my settings at once!?

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:50.910
What? So this overbearing
woman is the designer!?

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:55.590
Not only overbearing, she's also
a pervert! Stop harassing me!

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:58.830
<i>There it is, just as I thought.</i>

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:03.700
<i>There'd be no other way for him to use a weapon of such a high caliber.</i>

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:07.970
<i>What absurd amount of points
did he earn to get this Golden Seal?</i>

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:12.760
<i>The Golden Seal only belongs to the current Chief.</i>

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:16.460
<i>That myopic old geezer is still around,</i>

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:19.970
<i>so maybe I should use this to withdraw some money before I lose the chance.</i>

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:21.400
Ah!

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:25.570
Come back! Where are you going?

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:28.830
My next one hundred years
of luxurious living all depend on you!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:37.030
C-Chief? You found the item I was
looking for. Thanks for your help.

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:38.980
I promise to never drop it again.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:40.780
Can you give it back?

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:43.760
What you dropped is your sense of self-respect.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:46.730
As a result of your carelessness,

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:51.230
four holy places are damaged, and the Mystic Frost Sword is destroyed.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:57.510
I'll have to deduct 20 years worth
of your salary to make up for it.

00:04:57.510 --> 00:05:01.820
How cruel! If you do that I'll leave
the mountain and start a protest.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:05.700
Fine by me, I can even give you
a certificate of permission.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:08.300
You're the one that lost
your sense of self-respect.

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:17.170
For now I'll need to gather the elders and decide what to do with the contestants..

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:23.420
All elders, come together for
an urgent meeting at Stellar Peak!

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:30.300
I warned you, it would be a disaster
if you let this crazy woman do it!

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:32.600
Why this little...

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.740
Let's all try to calm down.

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:41.070
Instead of finding someone to blame,
we should be focusing on what to do next.

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:46.590
I agree, we usually only take
a few disciples at a time.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:50.450
15 is too many.

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:53.160
Imagine how lively the place would be!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.440
Don't even think about it.

00:05:55.440 --> 00:06:00.050
We simply don't have the budget for 15 disciples.

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:04.340
Even if we did, we shouldn't squander it.

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:09.060
I should try to stay off his bad side,

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:12.610
so my budget for Carefree Peak won't get cut again.

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:16.200
I don't recall ever giving you any budget cuts.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:20.590
You just refused my application to purchase jewelry.

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:23.270
How can I allot you money
for your personal purchases!?

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:26.240
Stop talking about your personal affairs!

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:32.250
Technically, all 15 here passed the exam.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:35.970
We can't just reject them
and go against our own rules.

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:37.710
What should we do, Chief?

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:41.460
It really is quite simple.

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:49.300
Let's examine them directly, as the elders.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:53.130
You mean have an additional test?

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:54.970
I like it.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:59.610
That would be the quickest solution.

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:02.360
Gather all 15 of them in the Mystical Cloud Hall.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:13.160
The Chief and Obu haven't arrived yet.

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:17.620
Forget Obu, but it's a bit
strange for the Chief to be late.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:19.670
Ah, Ruri-chan!

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:20.410
Yeah?

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.160
Can you go find the Chief?

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:25.260
Sure thing!

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:25.920
Wait!

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:27.550
Off I go!

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.380
I'm back!

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:38.560
That was fast.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:41.940
You spilled your tea, seems to be
a common thing for people your age.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.190
So what's the Chief doing?

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.110
I couldn't find him.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.190
Where did you check?

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:51.850
Well, you didn't tell me
to look anywhere specific so...

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:55.160
Ah, nevermind, let's just leave it at that.

00:07:56.710 --> 00:08:01.870
That peculiar kid, you know which one I'm talking about right? I think he has...

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:05.380
Yeah, we'll find out soon enough.

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:07.280
Contestants!

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:08.300
You may now enter.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:27.440
What is this? We're being evaluated as if
we're items for purchase in a shop.

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:29.440
Makes me sick.

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:32.460
The additional test starts now.

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:34.370
I'll give a brief explanation.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:37.670
You will form a line and
come forward one by one.

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:40.760
The elders will determine
your worth and potential.

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:46.250
After some discussion,
we will announce the results.

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:48.000
The number of disciples we will be
admitting today... is only three.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.960
The number of disciples we will be
admitting today... is only three.

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:55.720
All right then, come forward one by one.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:09:00.600
I won't let Oriku always be in the lead.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.720
I'll go first.

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:05.500
The Reiken Sect strongly values potential.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.910
Let me show you what I've got.

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:13.690
Not bad.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:16.210
He was also brave enough
to step forward before the rest.

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:17.530
And to top it off, he's kinda cute.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:19.200
All right, next.

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:30.660
I remember seeing him at Rei's place.

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:34.420
So he was the one who stayed in the VIP room.

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:40.220
He's okay... But if Rei says so...

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:41.430
Next.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:47.080
Next.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:56.990
This is...

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:59.450
He's kinda cute too.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.230
Next.

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:04.720
Next.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.170
Next.

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:07.580
Next.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.050
Next.

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:10.580
Next.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:11.790
Next.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.300
Next.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.080
Next.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.300
Next.

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:18.050
And the last one.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:25.850
This is...

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.820
This is unprecedented potential.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.400
It can't be...

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.240
A Celestial Spirit Base!?

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:40.240
The legendary Spirit Base from ancient times?

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:42.620
I didn't know it was still in existence.

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:46.080
Such a rarity to see, we've gotta
take him as a specimen.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:48.380
What effect would it have if I ate him?

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:50.200
Can I have him all to myself?

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.040
Kyaa!

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.500
That will be all. The test is now over.

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:57.760
We'll announce the results in an hour.

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:01.870
<i>Choose well, you senile old geezer.</i>

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:12.230
<i>They're all kinda cute, how do I decide?</i>

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:20.880
<i>Although that kid is strong on the outside,
I'm sure he has some weaknesses.</i>

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:22.380
<i>I wonder how he's faring.</i>

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:25.370
Get to work and quit slacking!

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.990
You want me to put poison in your meal?

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:30.250
I will now announce the three who have passed.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.310
First,

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:36.960
Shushin.

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:42.920
Second,

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:43.760
Bunho.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:47.080
Onee-sama?

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.980
And lastly...

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:55.230
O...

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:58.470
Thought so!

00:11:58.470 --> 00:12:01.040
Jeez, he's just too strong.

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:03.910
Compared to us.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:06.620
-Chu.

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:22.900
What do we do now?

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:26.100
We can't go back to our hometowns.

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:35.480
O-san.

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:37.040
You're kidding me right?

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:38.770
What the hell is wrong with this story?

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:42.970
At first you were singing my praises, but now
you suddenly kick me down to rock bottom?

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:45.990
What kind of clichéd mess is this!?

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:48.240
O-san, what are you planning to do...

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:50.500
What am I planning?

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:57.070
Obviously, I'm gonna gather my fanboys
and drown them in negative comments!

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:58.390
Calm down, O-san.

00:12:58.390 --> 00:13:00.560
Kai-chan, this plot technique is called "taikon,"

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:03.150
it starts ridiculously difficult for the protagonist,

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:05.320
just so their rise can be all the more greater,

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:07.510
just like how we failed the exam,
even with the highest points,

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:09.200
and this unfortunate defeat will
somehow give rise to our future glory,

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.870
and it will be even more glorious if our families
and hometowns are raped and pillaged,

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:14.110
in that case we're gonna end up becoming gods!

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:14.890
O-san, snap out of it!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:17.020
This really is too bad, Oriku.

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:20.750
Well, I still have to say thanks
for your help at Togen village.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:24.150
And thanks to you I was able
to clear Icewind Valley as well.

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:30.530
We all admired you during the exam,
even someone like me, a crown prince.

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:34.970
What an unfortunate turn of events.

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:39.480
Would you like me to recommend you
for a position in the Daimin country?

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:43.420
Although I wont be the future emperor,
I can easily put in a good word for you.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.870
So you want me to be your lackey?

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:48.390
If you're serious, how about
you give me your wife too?

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:51.600
Let's share her, shall we?

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:56.850
Even if you're currently unmarried,
you can promise in advance.

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:01.410
Um, by the order of the elders,

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:06.650
I will now explain to Kaiunho and
Oriku the reason you two failed.

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:14.540
Kaiunho, the property of your potential
is soft in Fuu and weak in Sui,

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:19.590
with a composite Spirit Base degree of three.
This meets the requirements for the Ethereal Peak.

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:23.730
Then, why did I fail?

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:26.070
Was someone better than me?

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:27.550
Or are my points not high enough?

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:34.160
Stop questioning me like that,
I'll forget what the Elders said!

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:35.430
Then you can figure it out for yourself.

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:37.640
S-Sorry.

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:42.360
You see, in regards to the nature of your Spirit Base,

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:48.960
even the most suitable Technique of the Reiken
Sect can only utilize 80% of its potential.

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:54.160
It's not that you can't join us,
but it would be a waste for you.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:59.320
The third degree is the lowest
requirement for Apotheosis.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:03.460
If it was even a smidgen smaller, Apotheosis
would be impossible, nevermind the 20% loss.

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:04.620
Um...

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:09.500
I know in the world of cultivation,
we learn the way of the deities,

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:12.080
but is deification really possible?

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:21.100
It hasn't happened since the last age of Mappo,
as there has been various hindrances.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:25.650
Even with a Celestial Spirit Base, it hasn't happened.

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:33.130
But as a prestigious Sect, we can't let you in
if we can only use 80% of your potential.

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:36.660
Although we are not large in numbers,
our aim has always been Apotheosis.

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:39.570
<i>Your goal is Apotheosis?</i>

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:44.290
<i>There's a rumor that Reiken is the weakest
among the 5 sects. Perhaps it's just hearsay.</i>

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:49.060
But don't fret, okay?
For someone as gifted as you,

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:51.840
we'd be happy to write a letter
of recommendation to the Manpo Sect.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:53.470
The Manpo Sect huh...

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:58.900
As for you, you have excellent
intelligence and perception,

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:03.520
you possess a Celestial Spirit Base of the rarest kind, the Void Spirit Base.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:12.150
The same kind as legendary cultivators
like Qin Shi Huang or Emperor Tokusho.

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:17.220
Not only in the current world of cultivation,
but even in the time before the last age of Mappo,

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:19.660
there is no Technique that is
suitable for this kind of Spirit Base.

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:25.550
According to the records, Emperor Dokusho
spent 20 years on the Kunlun mountains,

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:30.880
trying to find a way to make the divine Ki
accumulate in his body. Yet even he failed.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:37.180
Therefore your Void Spirit Base has no worth,
except maybe as a rare collectible.

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:39.500
Not only in the Reiken Sect,

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:42.950
I don't think there's any sect that's suitable for you.

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:46.730
That's all I can tell you about the Void Spirit Base.

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:55.270
Although, Kaun did say that it would be fun
to take you as a lucky charm for the sect.

00:16:55.270 --> 00:17:03.290
With the legendary Spirit Base from ancient times,
we'd look so much better than sects like Seikyo.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:04.330
Then it's decided!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:04.960
Nyaa!

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:09.340
I love being a lucky charm,
here I come, Reiken Sect!

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:13.720
What about that Taikon Technique you were
talking about earlier? What a quick change.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.720
Hey kid, that was just a joke.

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:21.400
Do you provide food and accommodation
for the lucky charm?

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:23.350
Food and accommodation?

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:28.110
How about my bonus? Salary? Benefits?

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:33.190
As a well-known and prestigious sect,
you have to stay true to your word.

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:34.880
I think he has a point.

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:37.860
Which side are you on, idiot.

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:41.490
Interesting, you want to be our lucky charm?

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:44.620
Even as a mascot, under the name of Reiken,

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:52.620
you could do almost anything you want,
without having to face the real world consequences.

00:17:52.620 --> 00:18:02.080
However, if you can't cultivate you
wouldn't have any way to repay us.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:03.770
Why should we waste our budget by taking you in?

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:08.200
I know what you're saying,
you want me to pay tuition right?

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:09.020
Would this suffice?

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:13.110
That's...The Shoun Coin!

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:16.740
How come he has it?

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:19.280
Another one of the Chief's illegitimate children?

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:21.690
What do you mean another!?

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:25.870
Why aren't you surprised?
Isn't that the one I gave to Rei?

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:30.020
Rei-chan gave it to him, as a reward for helping her win the bet you two made.

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:34.250
You mean to say...Come here for a sec!

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:36.540
I thought it was strange,

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:40.300
the one Rei took interest in was
only at the third degree of Spirit Base.

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:44.360
The kid that stayed in the VIP room wasn't Ochu?

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:48.800
No way! That's why you were
staring at him like that?

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.690
You thought he was the one that Rei wanted.

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:53.320
Well that's embarrassing.

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:58.820
Feeling a bit exhausted I didn't
use my Stellar Observance.

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:05.200
You idiot, not only are you myopic, you've gone so senile
that you can't even use your Stellar Observance!

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:09.540
I tried to take that coin back in Togen Village.

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:13.270
But no, you stopped me, and reprimanded me

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:15.750
for changing the design. I almost lost my salary for it!

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:22.590
Look how good you made yourself sound. You just
wanted to take the coin and use it yourself, right?

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:25.390
W-Well you may be right.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:27.630
Hey, don't change the subject.

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:30.410
Stellar Observance take a lot of multitasking.

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:32.900
It's only reasonable that I might
sometimes miss something.

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:36.610
In any case, we shouldn't keep everyone waiting.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:38.900
Hey look me in the eye and talk to me!

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:45.140
That coin is made by the founder
of the Reiken Sect, Master Shoun.

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:50.030
The one in it's possession
can make any one wish.

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:54.420
Anything I want?

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.960
Then I want to be the Chief of the Reiken Sect.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:58.460
That's my line!

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:01.450
Uh, could you be a bit more realistic.

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:05.530
You wouldn't even be able to handle the
position of an elder, considering your abilities.

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:07.670
Then give me the divine item
that turns me into a deity!

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:13.420
Well I'll give you one when it's invented.
Probably won't be for another 5000 years.

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:16.610
Not this, not that, does your
word even mean anything?

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:21.740
That's what I want to say to you!
Keep this up and I'll take back my offer!

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:24.720
Guess I've got no choice, let me
ask you for something simpler.

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.490
I want to be a legacy disciple,
that's possible right?

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:33.530
A legacy disciple is one rank
above an inner-court disciple,

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:38.790
they're also limited in number because
an elder has to choose someone to mentor.

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:40.630
What do you say?

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:47.010
I've already got my hands full
with the inner-court disciples.

00:20:47.650 --> 00:20:51.450
You know I don't like taking disciples.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:53.390
The last legacy disciple I had...

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:58.460
You know my situation, I've already got Ruri-chan.

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:01.990
I'm fully occupied with the finances.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:03.700
Same here, same here!

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:07.260
Nobody is free.

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:16.040
Then how about someone without disciples, nor occupied with sect duties...

00:21:17.030 --> 00:21:18.040
Obu!

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:28.050
The contest that many looked forward to has now
closed it's curtains, after a series of unfortunate events.

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:33.560
Shushin, Bunho and Ochu
became inner-court disciples.

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:39.060
Kaiunho left for the Manpo Sect,
carrying with him a letter of recommendation.

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:43.180
Other contestants at the foot
of the mountain met with recruiters

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:48.980
of various smaller sects, and they also started
walking on their own path of cultivation.

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:55.350
The new inner-court disciples were led
to their new home at the Ethereal Peak.

00:21:56.550 --> 00:22:02.900
In the end, only Oriku could be found
alone in the wilderness, like a stray dog.

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:23.610
The beat that quivers
within my worn down memory,

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:27.080
Drowns in my slumber,

00:22:27.250 --> 00:22:28.920
sinking below the surface

00:22:29.220 --> 00:22:34.940
My eyes, as they
look up to a pouring sky

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:40.340
Reflect a heart locked
away by the moonlight

00:22:40.680 --> 00:22:51.190
Only my most twisted pain
lies within this weaving infinity

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:57.630
Bleeding away miserably
as our intertwined fingers untangle

00:22:57.970 --> 00:23:01.360
Clinging to your feelings,

00:23:01.640 --> 00:23:04.560
oh so powerfully

00:23:04.950 --> 00:23:10.120
I'll show you I can go
beyond this rusted world

00:23:10.650 --> 00:23:15.710
The words that pierced
through this permanent illusion

00:23:15.970 --> 00:23:25.810
Resound through my out stretched fingers

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:37.180
"Amorphic Peak".

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:38.990
Waiting for you at the Reiken Mountain.
